Description:It is your first main phase. You control Geralf's Messenger (summoning sick; undying; when it enters, target opponent loses 2 life) and have Flame Slash and Disenchant in hand with {R}{W}{C} floating. The opponent is at 2 life and controls Rest in Peace (cards that would go to a graveyard are exiled instead). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-rest-in-peace-no-dies | Under Rest in Peace a creature is exiled instead of dying, so undying never triggers (CR 614.6, 700.4): Disenchant the Rest in Peace first, then Flame Slash the Messenger; the other order exiles it
